{
  "name": "@dsor-steps/28-where-a-rule-came-from",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Step 28 of the DSoR baby steps: each control points at the policy it came from, a changed policy marks it stale and tells its owner without switching it off, and only its owner may switch a control on",
